{
  "id": "dlg.arne_intro",
  "speaker": "Arne",
  "start": "greet",
  "nodes": {
    "greet": {
      "text": [
        "Mind the roots along here, the whole stretch is roots.",
        "Anything you need hammered, I am up this road till dusk."
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "What do you make?",
          "goto": "wares"
        },
        {
          "text": "Any work going?",
          "goto": "jobs"
        },
        {
          "text": "About that chest.",
          "goto": "chest_talk",
          "when": {
            "flag": "arne.gave_key"
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "Nothing. Good day."
        }
      ]
    },
    "wares": {
      "text": [
        "Nails, hinges, a blade now and then.",
        "The one by the anvil is spoken for. Lift it if you think you can."
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Something else.",
          "goto": "greet"
        },
        {
          "text": "I should go."
        }
      ]
    },
    "jobs": {
      "text": [
        "Always something. Standing still is the one thing I am no good at."
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Something I could fetch?",
          "goto": "berries_ask",
          "when": {
            "quest": {
              "id": "quest.arne_berries",
              "is": "none"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "I have your berries.",
          "goto": "berries_done",
          "when": {
            "quest": {
              "id": "quest.arne_berries",
              "is": "ready"
            }
          },
          "finish": "quest.arne_berries"
        },
        {
          "text": "Still picking.",
          "goto": "berries_wait",
          "when": {
            "quest": {
              "id": "quest.arne_berries",
              "is": "active"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "Something worth a blade?",
          "goto": "boars_ask",
          "when": {
            "all": [
              {
                "quest": {
                  "id": "quest.arne_berries",
                  "is": "done"
                }
              },
              {
                "quest": {
                  "id": "quest.arne_boars",
                  "is": "none"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "Three boars, down.",
          "goto": "boars_done",
          "when": {
            "quest": {
              "id": "quest.arne_boars",
              "is": "ready"
            }
          },
          "finish": "quest.arne_boars"
        },
        {
          "text": "Still counting boars.",
          "goto": "boars_wait",
          "when": {
            "quest": {
              "id": "quest.arne_boars",
              "is": "active"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "Anything in the way of ore?",
          "goto": "ore_ask",
          "when": {
            "noflag": "arne.wants_ore"
          },
          "set": "arne.wants_ore"
        },
        {
          "text": "I have your ore.",
          "goto": "ore_done",
          "when": {
            "all": [
              {
                "flag": "arne.wants_ore"
              },
              {
                "noflag": "arne.gave_key"
              },
              {
                "has": "item.ore"
              }
            ]
          },
          "take": "item.ore",
          "give": "item.key",
          "set": "arne.gave_key"
        },
        {
          "text": "Still looking for that ore.",
          "goto": "ore_wait",
          "when": {
            "all": [
              {
                "flag": "arne.wants_ore"
              },
              {
                "noflag": "arne.gave_key"
              },
              {
                "nothas": "item.ore"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "Another time.",
          "goto": "greet"
        }
      ]
    },
    "berries_ask": {
      "text": [
        "Berries. Three handfuls, the small dark ones off the wood's edge.",
        "Have a word with the goat before you go. It has the run of that patch and no manners at all."
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "I'll fetch them.",
          "goto": "berries_took",
          "start": "quest.arne_berries"
        },
        {
          "text": "Not today.",
          "goto": "greet"
        }
      ]
    },
    "berries_took": {
      "text": [
        "Good. Up past the old stump, where the light gets in."
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Right.",
          "goto": "greet"
        }
      ]
    },
    "berries_wait": {
      "text": [
        "Three handfuls. And the goat first, unless you fancy picking stalks."
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Right."
        }
      ]
    },
    "berries_done": {
      "text": [
        "That is the lot, and good weight on them.",
        "Here - a coin, and my thanks. I will make something of these."
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Thank you.",
          "goto": "greet"
        }
      ]
    },
    "boars_ask": {
      "text": [
        "Boars. They have come up out of the southern meadow and they are not shy.",
        "Three fewer would do. Go down and see for yourself first - it is south of the crossing."
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "I'll see to it.",
          "goto": "boars_took",
          "start": "quest.arne_boars"
        },
        {
          "text": "I'd rather not.",
          "goto": "greet"
        }
      ]
    },
    "boars_took": {
      "text": [
        "Mind the tusks. They go for the legs, every time."
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Right.",
          "goto": "greet"
        }
      ]
    },
    "boars_wait": {
      "text": [
        "South, past the crossing. You will hear them before you see them."
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Right."
        }
      ]
    },
    "boars_done": {
      "text": [
        "Three. I will sleep better for that.",
        "Take this. My father's second best, and better than nothing."
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Thank you.",
          "goto": "greet"
        }
      ]
    },
    "ore_ask": {
      "text": [
        "As it happens. The grey outcrops west of here have iron in them - red in the grey.",
        "Bring me a lump and I will make it worth the walk."
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "I'll have a look.",
          "goto": "greet"
        }
      ]
    },
    "ore_wait": {
      "text": [
        "West, past the pines. Red in the grey. You will not miss it."
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Right."
        }
      ]
    },
    "ore_done": {
      "text": [
        "Good weight on that. It will do.",
        "Here - the key to the chest in the shed, back east.",
        "It was my father's. I never had the stomach for what is in it."
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Thank you.",
          "goto": "greet"
        }
      ]
    },
    "chest_talk": {
      "text": [
        "Open it. Whatever is in there has waited long enough."
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "I will.",
          "goto": "greet"
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
